  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_Header.png\" alt=\"Header\" width=\"1903\" height=\"592\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_Overview.png\" alt=\"Overview\" width=\"1903\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/item_overview.png\" width=\"685\" height=\"387\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">元素锄/AIOT 不仅能创造耕地，还能创造<strong>超级耕地</strong>。它不需要水，而且从高处落下时不会变回泥土。还有那粉色的火花，<em>哇</em>！关于各个物品的更多信息，请参阅<strong>莱克西卡·博塔尼亚（Lexica Botania）</strong>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/raw/1.16.x/images/super_farmland.GIF\" width=\"500\" height=\"282\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_Recipe.png\" alt=\"Recipe Examples\" width=\"1903\" height=\"156\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">元素AIOT<br></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/recipes/elementium_aiot.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">活木剪刀<br></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/recipes/livingwood_shears.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">活岩剪刀</span></span><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/MelanX/aiotbotania/1.16.x/images/recipes/livingrock_shears.png\" width=\"372\" height=\"186\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://bisecthosting.com/images/CF/AIOT/BH_AT_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"Ad\" width=\"1903\" height=\"251\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:12px\">#广告 #赞助</span></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>",
